    "blurb": "Cognizant's Smart APP-Fraud Reimbursement Framework",
    "overview": "Cognizant's Smart APP-Fraud Reimbursement Framework, powered by the Camunda platform, offers a comprehensive solution, addressing the limitations of Reimbursement Claims Management System (RCMS) and empowering Payment Systems Regulators (PSRs) to effectively combat Authorized Push Payment (APP) fraud.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
