  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Cognizant's Smart APP-Fraud Reimbursement Framework",
    "splashDescription": "Cognizant's Smart APP-Fraud Reimbursement Framework, powered by the Camunda platform, offers a comprehensive solution, addressing the limitations of Reimbursement Claims Management System (RCMS) and empowering Payment Systems Regulators (PSRs) to effectively combat Authorized Push Payment (APP)  fraud. Our framework seamlessly integrates with RCMS and other critical banking systems (CRM, Fraud Prevention, Customer Communication), creating a unified view of fraud operations. the addressing the limitations of RCMS and empowering PSPs to effectively combat APP fraud. Our framework seamlessly integrates with RCMS and other critical banking systems (CRM, Fraud Prevention, Customer Communication), creating a unified view of fraud operations.\n\n*The APP Fraud Crisis: A Growing Threat\nAuthorized Push Payment (APP) fraud is exploding, crippling trust in digital banking. In the first half of 2024, UK victims lost £213.7 million to APP fraud, with losses for the entire year likely exceeding that figure.  Scammers manipulate individuals into transferring funds, often leaving victims with little recourse. The Payment Systems Regulator (PSR) has mandated reimbursement, placing a shared responsibility on sending and receiving Payment Service Providers (PSPs). While the Reimbursement Claims Management System (RCMS), as designed by Pay.UK, provides a foundation, it does not provide the necessary integration and customization capabilities.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/483754/overview/img900018821572089254.png?4331d1f711215560e360504fa416b73b",
    "imageSrcset": {
      "default": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/483754/overview/img900018821572089254.png",
      "2x": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/483754/overview/img900018821572089254-2x.png",
      "1x": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/483754/overview/img900018821572089254.png"
    },
    "demoUrl": "https://vimeo.com/1058668476?share=copy",
    "documentationUrl": "https://www.cognizant.com/uk/en/insights/blog/articles/beyond-reimbursement-claims-management-system-rcms-enhancing-app-fraud-reimbursement-for-uk-psps",
    "downloadDocumentationUrl": null,
    "systemRequirements": null,
    "downloadFileSize": null,
    "benefits": [
      {
        "title": "Seamless RCMS Integration",
        "description": "Automates claim creation, reducing manual effort and ensuring data consistency between your systems and RCMS."
      },
      {
        "title": "Enhanced System Integration",
        "description": "Connects with your CRM, Fraud Prevention, and Customer Communication platforms for a holistic view of customer interactions and fraud events."
      },
      {
        "title": "Customizable Workflows",
        "description": "Tailor the system to your specific needs, implementing business rules, SLAs, and automated processes."
      },
      {
        "title": "Advanced Fraud Insights",
        "description": "Leverage data analytics to identify trends, patterns, and vulnerabilities, enabling proactive fraud prevention."
      },
      {
        "title": "Intuitive User Interface",
        "description": "Simplify complex tasks for fraud specialists with user-friendly dashboards and streamlined workflows."
      },
      {
        "title": "Scalable & Flexible",
        "description": "Built on the Camunda platform, our framework adapts to evolving fraud tactics, new payment types, and regulatory changes."
      },
      {
        "title": "Improved Customer Experience",
        "description": "Streamlined processes and clear communication minimize customer frustration during fraud investigations."
      }
    ],
